# Grounded in the Orientation transcript (CD1 - 1) and the Gateway Experience
# Guidance Manual, Wave I. The source calls Focus 3 the starting point and says
# the count brings mind and brain into greater unison and coherence. This body
# guides that transition without inventing a sensation or a tone.

@segment  climb-f1-f3
@title    Climb — Waking to Focus 3
@levels   F3
@from     F1
@fixed
@verbosity 3
@duration ~45s

say To take another step along the path.
pause 3
say I will guide you to Focus 3, the starting point of the Gateway Experience.
pause 4
say I will count from 1 to 3
pause 3
say And when I reach three, your mind and brain will be much more in unison, much more coherent.
pause 3
say Much more complete.
pause 5
say I'm going to count now.
pause 3
level F3
say One.
pause 5
say Two.
pause 5
say Three.
pause 8
